# Copy to .env and fill in for local dev. .env is git-ignored.
#
# This is the PUBLIC frontend repo — it holds no backend secrets. The Supabase
# Edge Function, the corpus indexer, and their credentials (SUPABASE_URL /
# SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY / ANTHROPIC_API_KEY) live in the private ht-digital-twin repo.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Digital twin chat island (src/pages/index.astro, src/scripts/twin-chat.ts)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PUBLIC (client-exposed) — must be set at BUILD time, not just runtime, since
# Astro/Vite inlines PUBLIC_* vars into the client bundle. The deployed URL of
# the `digital-twin-chat` Supabase Edge Function, e.g.
# https://<project-ref>.supabase.co/functions/v1/digital-twin-chat
#
# In CI this is injected from the PUBLIC_TWIN_ENDPOINT repo secret (see
# .github/workflows/deploy.yaml). Left unset locally, the chat island falls back
# to a canned honest mock so the homepage stays demoable without a backend.
# PUBLIC_TWIN_ENDPOINT=https://xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx.supabase.co/functions/v1/digital-twin-chat
